def exact_inv(M: sp.Matrix) -> sp.Matrix:
    """EXACT inverse over the Gaussian rationals, no float and no simplifier.

    The landed chain uses sp.inv(method="LU") everywhere, but on the
    holonomy-DIALLED action -- entries in Q(i) with a nonzero real part in the
    coupling -- its intermediate fractions blow up: MEASURED at draft time, the
    landed LU route did NOT TERMINATE at 8x4 (16x16) after 7.5 minutes.
    DomainMatrix runs the same elimination inside the QQ_I domain.  GATED in
    gate B two ways: entry for entry against the landed LU route WHERE LU
    TERMINATES (the committed action), and by the residual Q Q^{-1} = 1 on the
    DIALLED actions, which is where the instrument is actually load-bearing --
    the placement the independent checker corrected.
    """
    return DomainMatrix.from_Matrix(M).to_field().inv().to_Matrix()


